  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Gu Yue Village has three taverns that sell common rice wine, muddy wine, and other similar common wine, in contrast to the expensive green bamboo wine at the sole inn.",
      "chapters": [
        12
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "common-tavern-stock",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_gu_yue_village"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Liquor worm can live on turbid wine or rice wine, but those second-rate wines force it to drink many jars every day, so Fang Yuan prefers green bamboo wine for cost and secrecy.",
      "chapters": [
        23
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "second-rate-gu-feed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_liquor_worm",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the inn, an old man sips rice wine while looking enviously at Fang Yuan’s green bamboo wine, which he cannot afford.",
      "chapters": [
        38
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "mortal-table-drink",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When green bamboo wine is sold out after a caravan visit, Fang Yuan orders a jar of rice wine and pre-orders the next bamboo brew.",
      "chapters": [
        64
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "substitute-when-sold-out",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the four wines for a Four Flavors Liquor Worm, rice wines can fit the sweet wine criteria, while bitter wines remain the hard slot to fill.",
      "chapters": [
        105
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sweet-fusion-stand-in",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_four_flavors_liquor_worm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A server later calls a jar the cheapest rice wine when Fang Yuan has no money for better liquor.",
      "chapters": [
        268
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
